cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "momentummgr: reaction-wheel momentum management, desaturation and scheduling"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "OPTIMA Organisation"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-02"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/OmAcharya-avtr/momentummgr"
abstract: >-
  Reaction-wheel momentum management for Earth-orbiting spacecraft: angular momentum
  accumulated from an independently implemented environmental disturbance model,
  cross-checked to 1.8e-11 relative against a sibling implementation; redundant wheel
  allocation with an exact null-space maximiser for zero-speed avoidance; magnetic and
  thruster desaturation with the instantaneous field-direction controllability constraint
  measured and the time-averaged controllability Gramian reported; and a learned
  desaturation scheduler benchmarked against a tuned fixed-threshold baseline on held-out
  episodes with bootstrap confidence intervals. Research-grade; not flight-qualified. The
  learned model is not certified for operational flight use.
keywords:
  - spacecraft
  - attitude control
  - momentum management
  - reaction wheel
  - desaturation
  - magnetorquer
